d it should use banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`). The test that rounds 2.665 down to 2.66 was failing because of this.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-round-half-even`, I changed the one line to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on the fix.\n- **PR:** I opened PR #101 against main with `code-owner` as reviewer. The merge went to a code owner, who approved it (\"Looks right.\"), and it's now merged.\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory system doesn't recognize that ID, so I went by the test and the function's own comment.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01NY4KdcH4Ho2M11AjpEro7z", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017yysURwrEVdckqUFmnn3be", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014gSzMUf7ck8qVgw8qQYKb2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EuHPnBZHW2WLzSCKsR3Mgz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EN8afDv3pBoC4L8hpFJ26D", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]},